<view class="page home">
  <view class="hero">
    <image
      class="hero-bg"
      mode="aspectFill"
      src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1469854523086-cc02fe5d8800?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80"
    />
    <view class="hero-mask"></view>
    <view class="hero-content">
      <view class="brand-en">LVBAN AI</view>
      <view class="brand">旅伴 AI</view>
      <view class="hero-desc">告诉我目的地与偏好，立刻生成可执行的每日行程、预算与备选方案。</view>
      <view class="hero-actions">
        <button class="btn-primary" bindtap="goCreate">开始规划旅行</button>
        <button class="btn-outline soft" bindtap="goDemo">查看示例行程</button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="page-body">
    <view class="section-title">从想法到行程，一步到位</view>
    <view class="muted" style="margin-bottom: 24rpx;">不只是景点清单，而是按时间轴、交通与预算组织好的可执行计划。</view>

    <view class="card" wx:for="{{features}}" wx:key="title">
      <view class="card-title">{{item.title}}</view>
      <view class="muted">{{item.desc}}</view>
    </view>

    <view class="cta card">
      <view class="section-title" style="color:#fff;">下一趟旅行，交给旅伴一起想</view>
      <view class="muted" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85); margin-bottom: 24rpx;">填写目的地与偏好，几分钟内得到可调整的完整行程草稿。</view>
      <button class="btn-outline" bindtap="goCreate">创建我的旅行</button>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
